## Runtime dependencies

The runtime dependencies declared in `pyproject.toml` and pinned by hash in `uv.lock`, with the license each package's metadata records:

| Package | License |
| --- | --- |
| aiohttp | Apache-2.0 (metadata expression: Apache-2.0 AND MIT) |
| apscheduler | MIT |
| croniter | MIT |
| httpx | BSD-3-Clause |
| jsonschema | MIT |
| mcp | MIT |
| pydantic | MIT |
| rfc3339-validator | MIT |
| rich | MIT |
| typer | MIT |

Notable transitive dependencies pinned by the same lock include click (BSD-3-Clause), starlette, uvicorn, and sse-starlette (BSD-3-Clause), and anyio, attrs, and pydantic-core (MIT). Development-only tooling (pytest and friends) is not shipped in the package or the coop container image.

The full machine-readable list of every pinned package, version, and hash is [docs/sbom.cdx.json](docs/sbom.cdx.json) (CycloneDX).
